{
  "_README": [
    "這是範本檔，Claude Code 不會載入它（只載入 .mcp.json）。",
    "實際的 .mcp.json 不進版控（見 .gitignore），每台機器保留自己的絕對路徑。",
    "使用方式：把本檔複製成 .mcp.json，再依你的作業系統填入下方對應路徑。",
    "",
    "[codesys] 只有 Windows 可用（CODESYS 是 Windows 軟體）。Mac 上請刪除整個 codesys 區塊。",
    "[qet] Windows / Mac 皆可，但 qet-mcp 與 QElectroTech 執行檔路徑各機不同，請自行調整。",
    "",
    "== Windows 範例路徑 ==",
    "  codesys command : C:/tools/node/node.exe",
    "  codesys bin.js  : C:/tools/Codesys_MCP/dist/bin.js",
    "  CODESYS exe     : C:/Program Files/CODESYS 3.5.22.10/CODESYS/Common/CODESYS.exe",
    "  profile         : CODESYS V3.5 SP22 Patch 1",
    "",
    "== macOS 範例路徑 ==",
    "  qet command     : python3",
    "  qet server.py   : /Users/<user>/Documents/ClaudeCodeDev/qet-mcp/server.py",
    "  QET_BINARY      : /Users/<user>/Documents/ClaudeCodeDev/QET-qeletrotech/build/qelectrotech.app/Contents/MacOS/qelectrotech",
    "  QET_ELEMENTS_DIR: /Users/<user>/Documents/ClaudeCodeDev/QET-qeletrotech/elements"
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "codesys": {
      "command": "<NODE_EXE>",
      "args": [
        "<CODESYS_MCP_BIN_JS>",
        "--codesys-path",
        "<CODESYS_EXE>",
        "--codesys-profile",
        "<CODESYS_PROFILE>",
        "--workspace",
        "<CODESYS_WORKSPACE_DIR>"
      ]
    },
    "qet": {
      "command": "python3",
      "args": [
        "<QET_MCP_DIR>/server.py"
      ],
      "env": {
        "QET_BINARY": "<QELECTROTECH_EXECUTABLE>",
        "QET_ELEMENTS_DIR": "<QET_ELEMENTS_DIR>"
      }
    }
  }
}
